# Claude session settings
# Exception: .claude/skills/ is committed (project-local skill definitions)
# CLAUDE.md files ARE committed — they carry the project's coding rules and
# are the canon agents and humans work from; keeping them untracked left the
# rules on one machine only. A global ~/.config/git/ignore rule excludes them
# everywhere, so re-include them explicitly for this repo.
!CLAUDE.md
!**/CLAUDE.md
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/hooks/
.claude/superpowers/
.claude/PROJECT-MAP.md
AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md

# Local agent tooling state
.claire/
.superpowers/

# GSD planning artifacts — committed as source of truth (reset 2026-05-24)
SPEC.md
